mapper.data:
{
  "models": ["anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6", "{{env.OPENROUTER_FALLBACK_MODEL}}"],
  "max_tokens": 500,
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You write warm, professional, concise business emails. Never mention internal tools, automation platforms, or CWI AI. Return only the email body — no subject line, no greeting header, no sign-off line unless instructed."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Write a warm 3-paragraph testimonial request email for {{1.body.contactFirstName}} {{1.body.contactLastName}}, a client of {{env.CLIENT_NAME}} who completed onboarding 30 days ago. The email should:\n1. Open by acknowledging their 30-day milestone and expressing genuine excitement about their progress.\n2. Ask them to do two things: (a) leave a Google review using the link that will be appended after the email body, and (b) share a short written testimonial (2-4 sentences) that we can feature on the website — they can simply reply to this email with their testimonial.\n3. Close warmly, make it feel personal and low-pressure, and thank them for being a client.\nReturn only the email body paragraphs. Do not include a subject line, greeting, or sign-off."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "from": "{{env.RESEND_FROM_ADDRESS}}",
  "to": ["{{1.body.contactEmail}}"],
  "subject": "Your 30-day milestone — could we ask a quick favour?",
  "text": "{{5.body.choices[0].message.content}}

Leave a Google Review:
{{env.GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK}}

Or simply reply to this email with 2-4 sentences about your experience and we'll feature it on our website.",
  "html": "<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;"><p>Hi {{1.body.contactFirstName}},</p>{{replace(replace(5.body.choices[0].message.content; '

'; '</p><p>'); '
'; '<br>')}}<p style="margin-top:28px;"><strong>1. Leave a Google Review</strong></p><p><a href="{{env.GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#4285F4;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">Leave a Google Review</a></p><p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;">Or copy this link: <a href="{{env.GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK}}">{{env.GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK}}</a></p><p style="margin-top:24px;"><strong>2. Share a Written Testimonial</strong></p><p>If you'd be willing to share 2-4 sentences about your experience for our website, simply reply to this email with your testimonial. We'll format it and send you a preview before publishing anything.</p><p style="margin-top:28px;font-size:13px;color:#888;">Thank you for being a client of {{env.CLIENT_NAME}}.</p></div>"
}

{
  "properties": {
    "hs_note_body": "Testimonial request sent — {{formatDate(now; 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm'; 'America/New_York')}} ET. Contact: {{1.body.contactFirstName}} {{1.body.contactLastName}} ({{1.body.contactEmail}}). Deal ID: {{1.body.dealId}}. Email sent from {{env.RESEND_FROM_ADDRESS}}. Google Review link: {{env.GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK}}. Client asked for both a Google review and a written website testimonial (reply to email). Sent via Make.com Scenario U.",
    "hs_timestamp": "{{formatDate(now; 'x')}}"
  },
  "associations": [
    {
      "to": {
        "id": "{{3.body.results[0].id}}"
      },
      "types": [
        {
          "associationCategory": "HUBSPOT_DEFINED",
          "associationTypeId": 202
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "from": "{{env.CWI_ALERT_FROM_ADDRESS}}",
  "to": ["{{env.CWI_ALERT_FROM_ADDRESS}}"],
  "subject": "Testimonial request sent — {{1.body.contactFirstName}} {{1.body.contactLastName}} ({{1.body.contactEmail}})",
  "html": "<h2 style='color:#1d4ed8;'>Testimonial Request Sent</h2><p>A testimonial request email was successfully sent 30 days after client onboarding.</p><table style='border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;'><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:bold;'>Client Name</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>{{1.body.contactFirstName}} {{1.body.contactLastName}}</td></tr><tr style='background:#f3f4f6;'><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:bold;'>Client Email</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>{{1.body.contactEmail}}</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:bold;'>Deal ID</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>{{1.body.dealId}}</td></tr><tr style='background:#f3f4f6;'><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:bold;'>Onboarding Date</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>{{1.body.onboardingDate}}</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:bold;'>Email Sent From</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>{{env.RESEND_FROM_ADDRESS}}</td></tr><tr style='background:#f3f4f6;'><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:bold;'>Google Review Link</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'><a href='{{env.GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK}}'>{{env.GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK}}</a></td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:bold;'>Sent At</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>{{formatDate(now; 'MMMM D, YYYY h:mm A'; 'America/New_York')}} ET</td></tr><tr style='background:#f3f4f6;'><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:bold;'>HubSpot Contact ID</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>{{3.body.results[0].id}}</td></tr></table><p>HubSpot note has been logged on the contact. If the client does not respond within 7 business days, follow up manually.</p><hr><p style='color:#888;font-size:12px;'><em>Automated alert from Make.com CWI Automation &mdash; Scenario U: Testimonial Request.</em></p>"
}

{
  "from": "{{env.CWI_ALERT_FROM_ADDRESS}}",
  "to": ["{{env.CWI_ALERT_FROM_ADDRESS}}"],
  "subject": "[ERROR] Make.com \u2014 Scenario U Testimonial Request Failed",
  "html": "<h2 style='color:#b00020;'>&#9888;&#65039; Scenario U \u2014 Testimonial Request Failed</h2><p>A step in the automated Testimonial Request flow failed. The testimonial request email may NOT have been delivered to the client \u2014 please verify and follow up manually.</p><hr><h3>Client</h3><ul><li><strong>Name:</strong> {{1.body.contactFirstName}} {{1.body.contactLastName}}</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> {{1.body.contactEmail}}</li><li><strong>Deal ID:</strong> {{1.body.dealId}}</li><li><strong>Onboarding Date:</strong> {{1.body.onboardingDate}}</li></ul><hr><h3>Error Details</h3><ul><li><strong>Error Message:</strong> {{error.message}}</li><li><strong>Failed Module:</strong> {{error.module}}</li><li><strong>Scenario Run ID:</strong> {{scenario.runId}}</li><li><strong>Timestamp:</strong> {{formatDate(now; 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss'; 'America/New_York')}} ET</li></ul><hr><p style='color:#888;font-size:12px;'><em>Automated alert from Make.com CWI Automation \u2014 Scenario U: Testimonial Request. Review the Make.com execution log and send the testimonial request manually if the email was not delivered.</em></p>"
}
